message: "If you use this dataset or report, cite it as below."
title: "Creatine Supplementation: An Independent Evidence Review and Product Database"
abstract: >-
  A structured review of creatine monohydrate and alternative formulations,
  covering efficacy, dosing, safety, special populations, product quality,
  certification, and cost per effective dose. Includes reproducible datasets
  and a validation pipeline.
